  "details": "The current iteration of prints is fun, but extremely disruptive to events that are being held. \n\nI'd like to see the option to mark a zone via a component or something similar to a collider to prevent prints from being brought in or printed in the zone. Something to prevent print spam in specific areas.\n\nOnce again, I think these are fun, but world creators need to have options to prevent people from just tossing them everywhere.",
